{"sha": "37d478483d7c05052d96df12829ae2cbc53253eda9a30925b0342e8330aef7a3", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.85]", "  \\draw[thick, fill=omMeth!20] (0,0) circle (0.5);", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (0,0) {$5$};", "  \\node[font=\\large] at (1.0,0) {$+$};", "  \\draw[thick, fill=omDef!20] (2.0,0) circle (0.42);", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (2.0,0) {$2$};", "  \\node[font=\\large] at (3.0,0) {$=$};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (4.0,0) {$7$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 面值 5 的硬币和面值 2 的硬币合起来是 7。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:measure:1}", "把三支铅笔一端对齐排成一排。哪一支最长？", "哪一支最短？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:measure:2}", "用直尺量一量：这本书的长边、你的小指、", "一把勺子。请以整厘米作答。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:measure:3}", "说出下列日期：星期一的后一天；星期日的前一天；星期五的后两天。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:measure:4}", "今天是星期四。昨天是星期几？明天是星期几？", "三天后是星期几？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:measure:5}", "画一个显示 $6$ 点的钟面。时针在哪里？", "分针在哪里？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:measure:6}", "读出整点：时针指向 $5$，分针指向 $12$；时针指向 $11$，", "分针指向 $12$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:measure:7}", "用两种不同的方法凑出 $8$，硬币面值为 $1$、$2$ 和 $5$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:measure:8}", "莱奥有一枚面值 $5$ 的硬币和三枚面值 $2$ 的硬币，", "他一共有多少钱？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:measure:9}", "一颗糖果售价 $3$，佐伊用一枚面值 $5$ 的硬币付款，", "她应找回多少钱？（从 $3$ 数到 $5$。）", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}